  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Vectors: finding a translation vector</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 2.2: Find the translation vector from a point and its image, and find a point from its image.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from Question B7 in Section B of Chapter 15 of Ling, J., Scruton, P., Shilton, S. and West, H., SMP GCSE Mathematics: Foundation 2 for AQA, Edexcel and OCR two-tier GCSE mathematics, Cambridge University Press, 2007: new numbers, Kenyan context, STACK randomisation, given by coordinates, the reverse step added, with named feedback and follow-through.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
